3fffe0242de462bfe728fb648cd4b07.png","width":426,"height":276,"width_mm":50.094,"row_group":"gaosan-mingxiao-xiezuoti-2409-q16-row4"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/cbd1092d63dfb0e425d9191378f005791c26c3f8442ddce5112f5fd39ecf1815.png","width":309,"height":285,"width_mm":36.336,"row_group":"gaosan-mingxiao-xiezuoti-2409-q16-row4"},{"type":"text","value":"\n（2）如图a所示为某品牌方块电池，小文同学分别用电路图b和电路图c测量此方块电池的电源电动势和内阻。他选用的电压表量程15V、内阻未知，电流表量程0.6A、内阻等于0.5"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Omega"},{"type":"text","value":"，滑动变阻器 "},{"type":"math","value":"R(0\\sim100\\Omega)"},{"type":"text","value":" 。规范实验并根据测量数据描绘的U-I图线分别得到如图d中I、II所示。完成下列几个问题。\n①根据电路图b测量数据描绘的U-I图线应为图d中 （填空） (填“I”或“II”)\n②根据题中条件，本次实验应选择实验电路图中 （填空） (填“图b”或“图c”)。\n③综合分析可得该电源电动势为 （填空） V，内阻为 （填空） "},{"type":"math","value":"\\Omega"},{"type":"text","value":"。(保留 3 位有效数字)\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/9b3943cca93d6ae9e4f06ac901503f4b0a678605000bac30b704a82623b3c066.png","width":798,"height":345,"width_mm":93.839,"row_group":"gaosan-mingxiao-xiezuoti-2409-q16-row5"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/7e63c3d0d8c1bfc779eb12beb6ef27ab295ca3a26c8a958749c58e49e0afad23.png","width":489,"height":411,"width_mm":63.253,"row_group":"gaosan-mingxiao-xiezuoti-2409-q16-row5"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第 16-II 题图 4\n16-III.(3 分) 在“用双缝干涉测量光的波长”的实验中, 装置如图所示:\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/352c54aec5ff58923f89e777eb4f2f974c049d5a3fa11e3d1cf2e457d8c85104.png","width":858,"height":313,"width_mm":100.894,"row_group":"gaosan-mingxiao-xiezuoti-2409-q16-row6"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/87f10e76307828b2d345cdcf9e95879898a777fc3d1a9a6cb735cd6c286f7fe9.png","width":426,"height":313,"width_mm":50.094,"row_group":"gaosan-mingxiao-xiezuoti-2409-q16-row6"},{"type":"text","value":"\n(1) 双缝装置是图中的 （填空） (选填“A”或“B”)。\n(2) 某同学在观察时发现条纹比较模糊, 可以通过调节 （填空） 装置 (填装置名称)。\n（3）甲、乙两同学通过目镜，分别看到如图所示的甲、乙两种情形。由于条纹清晰，他们没有再进一步进行调节，而是直接进行测量，并根据公式算出波长，测量得到的波长准确的是 （填空） （选填“甲”或“乙”）。"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"16. 实验题（I、II、III 两题共 14 分）\n16-I. (5 分) (1) ABD (2 分, 不全得 1 分) ACD (2 分, 不全得 1 分) (2) 0.18～0.19 (1 分)\n16-II. (6 分) (1) (1) ①甲 (1 分) ②R (1 分)\n(2) ①II (1 分) ②图 b (1 分) ③9.00 (8.98-9.02) (1 分) 0.500 (0.460～0.540)\n(1 分)\n16-III.(3分) (1) B (1分) (2) 拨杆 (1分) (3) 甲 (1分)"}]}},{"id":"zj-25-shoukao--gaosan-mingxiao-xiezuoti-2409-q17","paper_id":"zj-25-shoukao--gaosan-mingxiao-xiezuoti-2409","source_question_id":"gaosan-mingxiao-xiezuoti-2409-q17","number":"17","order":17,"type":"计算题","topics":["热学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"cc474ea1a00d20b722ac0fee263f83ea0fc90cfc465b1fbbfa302597deaa2577","body":[{"type":"text","value":"17.（8分）如图所示，一不占体积的导热光滑活塞 C 与一段水银柱在气室 A 中封存着一定量的气体。此时气室温度与环境温度都为 "},{"type":"math","value":"T_{0}=300K"},{"type":"text","value":" 。体积为 "},{"type":"math","value":"V_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":" （已知）的绝热容器分成 A、B 两室，B 室的体积是 A 室的两倍，A 室容器上连接一 U 形管（U 形管内气体的体积忽略不计），两边水银柱高度差为 "},{"type":"math","value":"38 \\, cm"},{"type":"text","value":" ，B 室容器中的气体通过阀门 K，可与外界大气相通（外界大气压等于 "},{"type":"math","value":"76 \\, cmHg"},{"type":"text","value":" ）。求：\n(1) 将阀门 "},{"type":"math","value":"K"},{"type":"text","value":" 打开后, 气室 "},{"type":"math","value":"A"},{"type":"text","value":" 内的气体 （填空） (填“吸热”、“放热”或“既不吸热也不放热”); 气室 "},{"type":"math","value":"A"},{"type":"text","value":" 内的气体对活塞 "},{"type":"math","value":"C"},{"type":"text","value":" 单位面积上的压力 （填空） (填“变大”、“变小”或“不变”)。\n(2) 将阀门 K 打开后，A 室的体积变成多少？\n（3）在打开阀门 K 后将气室 A 的气体从 300K 加热到 660K，则 U 形管内两边水银面的高度差为多少？\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/71b1d29a0c2031083867bcce8f857290c34fa34ed788cee000fdd9fa1f04eb90.png","width":349,"height":324,"width_mm":40.941,"row_group":"gaosan-mingxiao-xiezuoti-2409-q17-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第 17 题图"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"17. (8分) (1) 吸热 (1分) 变小 (1分)\n（2）设大气压为"},{"type":"math","value":"P_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":"，开始时"},{"type":"math","value":"p_{A0}=\\frac{3}{2}p_{0}\\quad V_{A0}=\\frac{1}{3}V_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":"\n打开阀门，A室气体等温变化，此时"},{"type":"math","value":"p_{A}=p_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":"\n设体积"},{"type":"math","value":"V_{A}"},{"type":"text","value":"，根据玻意耳定律有"},{"type":"math","value":"p_{A0}V_{A0}=p_{A}V_{A}"},{"type":"text","value":"（2分）\n解得"},{"type":"math","value":"V_{A} = \\frac{p_{A0}V_{A0}}{p_{A}} = \\frac{V_{0}}{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n（3）假设打开阀门后，气体从"},{"type":"math","value":"T_{0}=300K"},{"type":"text","value":"升到"},{"type":"math","value":"T"},{"type":"text","value":"时，活塞C恰好到达容器最右端，即气体体积变为"},{"type":"math","value":"V_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":"，压强"},{"type":"math","value":"p_{A}"},{"type":"text","value":"仍为"},{"type":"math","value":"p_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":"，即等压变化过程，根据盖·吕萨克定律"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{V_{1}}{T_{1}}=\\frac{V_{2}}{T_{2}}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n得"},{"type":"math","value":"T=\\frac{V_{0}}{V_{A}}T_{0}=600K"},{"type":"text","value":"\n从"},{"type":"math","value":"T=600K"},{"type":"text","value":"升高到"},{"type":"math","value":"T_{2}=660K"},{"type":"text","value":"，发生等容变化过程，根据查理定律"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{p_{A}}{T}=\\frac{p_{A2}}{T_{2}}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n得"},{"type":"math","value":"p_{A2} = 1.1p_0"},{"type":"text","value":"\n水银面的高度差为"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta h = (1.1 - 1) \\times 76 \\, \\text{cm} = 7.6 \\, \\text{cm}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）\n（注：用理想气体状态方程求解，同样给分）"}]}},{"id":"zj-25-shoukao--gaosan-mingxiao-xiezuoti-2409-q18","paper_id":"zj-25-shoukao--gaosan-mingxiao-xiezuoti-2409","source_question_id":"gaosan-mingxiao-xiezuoti-2409-q18","number":"18","order":18,"type":"计算题","topics":["力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"0c78c894889b9a9d3d02cc2cec170943a0b1cbd5ce6db232e66b0c0fe3fa69a1","body":[{"type":"text","value":"18.（11分）某物理研究小组同学设计的弹射装置如图，改变弹性势能，可改变小物块水平进入圆弧轨道 "},{"type":"math","value":"A"},{"type":"text","value":" 点的速度。已知光滑的 "},{"type":"math","value":"AB"},{"type":"text","value":" 段圆弧半径 "},{"type":"math","value":"R = 0.5\\mathrm{m}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，圆心角 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\theta = 53^{\\circ}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，直轨道 "},{"type":"math","value":"BC"},{"type":"text","value":" 倾角也为 "},{"type":"math","value":"53^{\\circ}"},{"type":"text","value":" ， "},{"type":"math","value":"BC"},{"type":"text","value":" 段长为 "},{"type":"math","value":"l_{1} = 0.7\\mathrm{m}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，动摩擦因数为 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\mu_{1} = \\frac{1}{3}"},{"type":"text","value":" 。长木板左端与水平平台右端紧靠在 "},{"type":"math","value":"D"},{"type":"text","value":" 点，表面相平， "},{"type":"math","value":"CD"},{"type":"text","value":" 长为 "},{"type":"math","value":"l_{2} = 0.6\\mathrm{m}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，小物块质量 "},{"type":"math","value":"m = 0.2\\mathrm{kg}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，长木板质量 "},{"type":"math","value":"M = 0.4\\mathrm{kg}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，小物块与长木板的动摩擦因数为 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\mu_{2} = 0.15"},{"type":"text","value":" ，地面光滑。 "},{"type":"math","value":"(\\sin 53^{\\circ} = 0.8, \\cos 53^{\\circ} = 0.6)"},{"type":"text","value":" 求：\n（1）当弹射装置释放的弹性势能为0.8J时，求小物块第一次经过圆弧面B点时，向心加速度的大小；\n(2) 改变弹射装置释放的弹性势能, 若小物块经过轨道 "},{"type":"math","value":"A"},{"type":"text","value":"、"},{"type":"math","value":"B"},{"type":"text","value":"、"},{"type":"math","value":"C"},{"type":"text","value":" 后正好落在长木板左端 "},{"type":"math","value":"D"},{"type":"text","value":" 点, 求小物块从 "},{"type":"math","value":"B"},{"type":"text","value":" 点到 "},{"type":"math","value":"D"},{"type":"text","value":" 点的运动时间;\n（3）小物块落到长木板左端D点后，假设竖直方向速度变为零，水平方向速度不变，要使小物块不滑离长木板，求长木板的最小长度。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/13424179f54afd099a460a3910196ab83bfd18e2e36700ecc64efd5f1987b4f8.png","width":542,"height":243,"width_mm":63.577,"row_group":"gaosan-mingxiao-xiezuoti-2409-q18-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第18题图\n\n原卷公共参数：本卷中无特殊说明，重力加速度 "},{"type":"math","value":"g"},{"type":"text","value":" 均取 "},{"type":"math","value":"10\\mathrm{m / s^2}"},{"type":"text","value":" 。\n"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"18.(11 分) (1) 小物块从弹离到第一次经过圆弧面"},{"type":"math","value":"B"},{"type":"text","value":"点过程分析有:"},{"type":"math","value":"\\mathrm{E_p - mgR(1 - \\cos\\theta) = \\frac{1}{2}mv_B^2}"},{"type":"text","value":"(1 分) 得"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{\\mathrm{B}} = 2\\mathrm{m / s}"},{"type":"text","value":"B 受力分析有:"},{"type":"math","value":"a_{n} = \\frac{v_{\\mathrm{B}}^{2}}{\\mathrm{R}}"},{"type":"text","value":"(1 分)"},{"type":"math","value":"a_{n} = 8m / s^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"(1 分)\n（2）从 C 到 D 的过程中，设上升的时间为"},{"type":"math","value":"t_{1}, CD"},{"type":"text","value":"段总时间"},{"type":"math","value":"2t_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"竖直方向位移满足："},{"type":"math","value":"v_{c}\\sin\\theta = gt_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"(1 分)"},{"type":"text","value":"水平方向位移满足："},{"type":"math","value":"l_{2}=v_{c}\\cos\\theta\\cdot2t_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"(1 分)\n联立求得："},{"type":"math","value":"t_{1}=0.2s,\\quad v_{C}=2.5m/s"},{"type":"text","value":"在斜坡 BC 上物体加速度"},{"type":"math","value":"a=\\left(\\mathrm{g}\\sin\\theta+\\mu_{1}\\mathrm{g}\\cos\\theta\\right)"},{"type":"text","value":"(1 分)"},{"type":"math","value":"a=10m/s^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"又"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{B}^{2}-v_{C}^{2}=2al_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"(1 分) （写"},{"type":"math","value":"l_{1}=v_{c}t_{2}+\\frac{1}{2}at^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"也给 1 分）\n求得"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{B}=4.5m/s, t_{2}=0.2s"},{"type":"math","value":"t_{\\text{总}}=2t_{1}+t_{2}=0.6s"},{"type":"text","value":"(1 分)\n（3）落在木板上后，仅保留水平速度"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{x}=v_{c}\\cos53^{\\circ}=1.5m/s"},{"type":"text","value":"与木板 DE 共速后，不会滑离长木板："},{"type":"math","value":"mv_{x}=(M+m)v_{\\text{共}}"},{"type":"text","value":"(1 分) "},{"type":"math","value":"v_{\\text{共}}=0.5m/s"},{"type":"text","value":"根据能量关系："},{"type":"math","value":"-\\mu_{2}mgL=\\frac{1}{2}(m+M)v_{\\text{共}}^{2}-\\frac{1}{2}mv_{x}^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"(1 分)\n即木板最小长度 L=0.5m（1 分）\n(答案分只看答案, 过程分只看过程, 严格按过程要求给分)"}]}},{"id":"zj-2